cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Predicting Showjumping Outcomes with Self-Supervised Video Representations"
authors:
  - family-names: Ballhaus
    given-names: Brooke
date-released: 2026-06-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/bballhaus/showjumping-ssl"
license: MIT
abstract: "A Stanford CS 131 project that pretrains a self-supervised R(2+1)D-18 video encoder on takeoff-anchored showjumping broadcast clips, with a venue-balanced sampler and domain-adversarial head to counter the venue confound, and fine-tunes it to predict jump outcome and takeoff distance."
